DARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2704,"row":{"en":"They can help to improve soil quality and water the plants.","wo":"Mën nañu gëna baaxal suuf si ak garab yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeun nagnou geuna bakhal souf si ak garab yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2705,"row":{"en":"The Zambian economy has been struggling in recent years due to low copper prices.","wo":"Koom-koomu Zambie mingi dundu ay jafe-jafe ndax njëgu përëm bi daanu at yu mujj yii.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKoom koomou zambie mingui doundou ay diafé diafé ndakh nieudjou preum bi danou at you moudj yii.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2706,"row":{"en":"Hippie musicians sought to create music that was both beautiful and meaningful, and they often drew inspiration from a variety of sources, including Eastern philosophy, world music, and psychedelic drugs.","wo":"Waykati hippie yi dañu fexe sos music buy boole neex ba noopi di yeete, ba noppi dañu daan roy ci ñu bari te wuute, lu ci melni filosofi waa penku, world music, ak drog psychedelic.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWaykat yi hippie yi daniou fékhé soss music bouy boolé nékh ba noppi di yété, ba noppi daniou dane roy si gnou bari té wouté, lou si melni filosofi wa penkou, world music ak drog psychedelic.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2707,"row":{"en":"A: I don't know if I can ask for an extension.","wo":"A: Xamuma ndax mën naa ñaan ñu yokkal ma àpp bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nA: Khamouma ndakh meun naa gnane gnou yokkal ma app bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2708,"row":{"en":"He closed his eyes and said a prayer.","wo":"Mu tëj ay bëtam daal di ñaan.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou teudj ay beuteum daldi gnane.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2709,"row":{"en":"Sudan was ruled by a series of Arab sultanates for centuries, until it was conquered by Egypt in 1821.","wo":"Ay sultan araab jiitu nañu Sudan diiru xarnu yu bari, ba keroog waa Egypt jële leen fa ci atum 1821.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAy sultan arab djitou nagnou Soudan diirou kharniou you bari, ba kerog wa egypt dieulé léne fa thi atoum 1821.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2710,"row":{"en":"But in the hands of a skilled cook, they become something more: they become extensions of the cook's own body, tools that allow him or her to express creativity and passion.","wo":"Waaye suñu nekkee ci loxo ku mën togg, dañuy nekk lu raw loolu: dañuy dem ba nekk cër bu sax ci kiy togg, jumtukaay yu koy may mu wane xarañteem ak bëgg-bëggam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé souniou nekkeu thi lokho kou meun togue, dagnouy nekk lou raw lolou: dagnouy dem ba nekk thieur bou sakh thi kiy togue, jumtoukay you koy may mou wané kharantém ak beug-beugam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2711,"row":{"en":"Her granddaughter, a teenager, is sitting on the couch, watching TV.","wo":"Sëtam bu jigéen, biy wara tollu ci fukki at baa ngi toog ci kanape bi di seetaan tele.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSetam bou djiguéne, biy wara tollou thi fouki att ba ngui togue thi canapé bi di sétane télé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2712,"row":{"en":"The destiny of Nigeria is not to be a land of division and conflict.","wo":"Ëlëg Nigeria warul nekk réewu xaajaloo ak xeex.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nEuleuk Nigeria waroul neuk rewou khadialo ak khekh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2713,"row":{"en":"He ate them at home, at school, and at restaurants.","wo":"Moom lay lekk ci kër ga, ci daara ja, ak ci resto yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMome lay lekk thi keur ga, thi daara dja, ak thi resto yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2714,"row":{"en":"We decided to stop in and see what it was all about.","wo":"Nuni nanu taxaw xool nu mbir yi di deme.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNo