[]},{"row_idx":2726,"row":{"en":"In recent years, there have been growing threats to freedom of the press around the world.","wo":"Ci at yii weesu, barina jafe-jafe yuy gàllankoor sañ-sañu fësal xibaar boobu ci àdduna bi yépp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCi att yii wessou barina diafé diafé youy galankoor sagn sagnou fessal khibaar bobou ci addouna bi yeup.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2727,"row":{"en":"Just then, the police chief walks into the theater and sees his daughter's distress.","wo":"Ci noonu la njiitu poliis bi duggsi ci teyaatar bi gis doomam jaaxle.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThi nonou la njiitou police bi dougsi thi theatre bi guiss domam diakhle.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2728,"row":{"en":"Indeed, various ancient tribes subsisted primarily on meat.","wo":"Dëgg la ca jamono nit ñu njëgg ña, yàgg nañu di dundee yàpp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDeug la ca diamono nitt gnou ndieugg nia yague nagnou di doundé yapp.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2729,"row":{"en":"Extra lengths of drill pipe visible on the machine are added as the boring progresses.","wo":"Guddaayi fiil yiñ yokk ci tige forage yi nga koy gis ci masin bi dañu leen di gëna yokk luñuy gëna gas forage bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGouddayi fil yign yok thi tige forage yi ngakoy guiss thi massine bi dagnou len di geuna yok lougnouy geuna gas forage bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2730,"row":{"en":"You'll just end up being more tired and stressed, and you won't do your best work.","wo":"Soo ko defee dangay mujjee sonn ba noppi sa xol du neex, te doo def liggéey bi gën.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo ko défé dangay moudié sonn ba noppi sa khol dou nékh té do déf liguey bi geuné.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2731,"row":{"en":"These middle layers also pile on a little more warmth to fight off the winter chill.","wo":"Yii xàjjalekaay ci 