truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2741,"row":{"en":"After math class, we had a break.","wo":"Bi kuuru math jeexee nu noppalu tuuti.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi courou math diékhé niou noppalou touti\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2742,"row":{"en":"If you’re aware that you’re the most qualified for the occupation, reveal it.","wo":"Sudee danga jàpp ni yaa gëna yelloo liggéey bii, wane ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou dé dangua diap ni ya gueuna yello liguey bi wané ko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2743,"row":{"en":"Accessories lend visual appeal through pattern and texture.","wo":"Jumtukaay yi deñuy jox nataal yi ak bind yi ay melokaan.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nJumtoukay yi degnou diokh nataal yi ak bind yi ay melokane.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2744,"row":{"en":"When there is no light, we can't see anything.","wo":"Su leer amul, dunu mëna gis dara.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou leer amoul dougnou meuna guiss dara.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2745,"row":{"en":"It felt good to know that we were helping to save lives.","wo":"Ma yëg mbégte ci sama xol ndax lima dimbali nit mu mucci.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa yeug mbegteh thi sama khol ndakh lima dimbeuli nitt mou mouthie.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2746,"row":{"en":"It is a predator that feeds on my very essence, leaving me feeling weak and vulnerable.","wo":"Rëbbkat la buy dundee kima doon, bàyyi ma duma dese benn kàttan, ma ñàkk njariñ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nReubkat la bouy doundé kima done, bayi ma douma déssé bene katane, ma gnak njarigne.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2747,"row":{"en":"After a few bites, he stops and says, This steak is terrible! It's tough and tasteless.","wo":"Bimu xàmpee tuuti, mu taxaw ni, Steak bi neexul dara, dafa dëgër ba noppi amul cafka.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBimo